  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Every moment of my life was a mess.\"\n\"This is by far the worst choice I've ever made.\"\nKang Hye-ri, who used to hang out with low-quality friends during her school days and cause trouble, finds her life spiraling downward the moment she implicated in a classmate's murder case. With a history of various assaults and frauds, all she has left is a mountain of loan shark debt and a shabby semi-basement studio apartment.\nTo repay her debts, Hye-ri resorts to kidnapping a woman walking out of a wealthy house late at night...\nBut as fate would have it, the woman Hye-ri kidnaps turns out to be a cross-dressing serial killer.\nJust when she thought she had abducted some pervert, the woman's words are even more shocking:\n\"If I had to choose, I prefer women like you."
  },
